  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0003','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0003','Resource Development','Resource Development','The adversary is trying to establish resources they can use to support operations against AI systems.','technical','medium'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0004','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0004','Initial Access','Initial Access','The adversary is trying to gain access to the AI system, which may include the network, ML infrastructure, or software.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0000','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0000','AI Model Access','AI Model Access','The adversary is attempting to gain some level of access to an AI model, ranging from full knowledge of internals to API access.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0005','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0005','Execution','Execution','The adversary is trying to run malicious code embedded in or delivered through the AI system.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0006','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0006','Persistence','Persistence','The adversary is trying to maintain their foothold via artifacts such as poisoned data or backdoored models.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0012','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0012','Privilege Escalation','Privilege Escalation','The adversary is trying to gain higher-level permissions within the AI system or its environment.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0007','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0007','Defense Evasion','Defense Evasion','The adversary is trying to avoid being detected by AI-enabled security software and other defenses.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0013','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0013','Credential Access','Credential Access','The adversary is trying to steal account names and passwords or other credentials.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0008','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0008','Discovery','Discovery','The adversary is trying to figure out the AI environment to orient themselves before acting.','technical','medium'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0015','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0015','Lateral Movement','Lateral Movement','The adversary is trying to move through the environment to reach their objective.','technical','medium'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0009','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0009','Collection','Collection','The adversary is trying to gather AI artifacts and other related information relevant to their goal.','technical','medium'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0001','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0001','AI Attack Staging','AI Attack Staging','The adversary is leveraging their knowledge of and access to the target system to tailor the attack, for example by crafting adversarial data or creating proxy models.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0014','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0014','Command and Control','Command and Control','The adversary is trying to communicate with and control compromised systems.','technical','medium'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0010','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0010','Exfiltration','Exfiltration','The adversary is trying to steal AI artifacts or other information about the AI system.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-ta0011','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.TA0011','Impact','Impact','The adversary is trying to manipulate, interrupt, erode confidence in, or destroy AI systems and data.','technical','high'),
  -- representative techniques
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0051','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0051','Initial Access','LLM Prompt Injection','An adversary crafts malicious prompts as inputs to an LLM, causing it to act in unintended ways, whether directly by the operator or indirectly through third-party content.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0054','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0054','Defense Evasion','LLM Jailbreak','An adversary uses a prompt injection to bypass restrictions placed on an LLM, allowing it to produce content or take actions that would otherwise be restrained.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0020','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0020','Persistence','Poison Training Data','Adversaries may modify the training data of an AI model to embed vulnerabilities or backdoors, or to degrade model performance.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0010','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0010','Initial Access','AI Supply Chain Compromise','Adversaries may gain initial access by compromising portions of the AI supply chain, including hardware, software, data, or the model itself.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0015','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0015','Defense Evasion','Evade AI Model','Adversaries craft adversarial inputs so that the AI model produces an incorrect result, evading detection or the model''s intended function.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0043','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0043','AI Attack Staging','Craft Adversarial Data','Adversaries craft adversarial data that, when input to a model, produce a desired incorrect or attacker-chosen output.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0024','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0024','Exfiltration','Exfiltration via AI Inference API','Adversaries exfiltrate information through the model''s inference API, for example by inferring training-data membership, inverting the model, or extracting the model.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0029','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0029','Impact','Denial of AI Service','Adversaries target AI systems with a flood of requests to degrade or shut down the service.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0056','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0056','Discovery','Extract LLM System Prompt','Adversaries extract the system prompt of an LLM to learn about its configuration, instructions, or guardrails.','technical','medium'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0057','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0057','Exfiltration','LLM Data Leakage','Adversaries induce an LLM to reveal sensitive information present in its prompts, context, or training data.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0018','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0018','Persistence','Manipulate AI Model','Adversaries manipulate an AI model by poisoning it or modifying its architecture to embed persistent malicious behavior.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0040','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0040','AI Model Access','AI Model Inference API Access','Adversaries gain access to a model through its inference API, which they can use to craft attacks or extract information.','technical','medium'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0048','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0048','Impact','External Harms','Adversaries use their access to cause harms external to the AI system, including financial, reputational, societal, and user harm, or theft of AI intellectual property.','technical','high'),
  ('fc-mitre-atlas-aml-t0053','00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','mitre-atlas','AML.T0053','Execution','AI Agent Tool Invocation','Adversaries abuse an AI agent''s ability to invoke tools or extensions to execute unintended actions in connected systems.','technical','high')
